{"id":"n42192-1-9","stage":5,"title":"단번에 · 一下子","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n42192-1-9-1","ko":"너는 왜 동생이랑 싸우니?","zh":"你为什么和弟弟吵架啊？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"너는","meaning":"你","explanation":"너：你；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"너","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64390","senseId":"1","lemma":"너","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"너는","audio":"/audio/54abca9caefe5ae47b8e.mp3"}},{"text":"왜","meaning":"为什么","explanation":"왜：为什么","readings":[{"term":"왜","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67848","senseId":"1","lemma":"왜","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"왜","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3"}},{"text":"동생이랑","meaning":"弟弟；妹妹","explanation":"동생：弟弟；妹妹；이랑：连接共同参与或比较的对象，常表示“和、与”；结合句中动作理解。","readings":[{"term":"동생","audio":"/audio/bc9b651fd875fefcac75.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70748","senseId":"1","lemma":"동생","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"동생이랑","audio":"/audio/dab88134e262ec7fd91c.mp3"}},{"text":"싸우니?","meaning":"打架，争斗","explanation":"싸우다：打架，争斗；니：非敬语疑问句末，用于亲近的人、晚辈或自问。","readings":[{"term":"싸우다","audio":"/audio/e27f0e273d4af17d7ed1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29732","senseId":"1","lemma":"싸우다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"싸우니","audio":"/audio/5086ab20af4b957fe5a9.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"734dae8e9d9a8f8b","term":"너","zh":"你","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3","entryId":"64390","definition":"指代听者，用于朋友或晚辈。","pronunciation":["너"]},{"id":"08b35eb63efd4aaa","term":"왜","zh":"为什么","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3","entryId":"67848","definition":"因什么原因；或指怎么。","pronunciation":["왜ː"]},{"id":"bc9b651fd875fefc","term":"동생","zh":"弟弟；妹妹","audio":"/audio/bc9b651fd875fefcac75.mp3","entryId":"70748","definition":"用于指称或称呼相同父母所生的兄弟姐妹或亲戚兄弟姐妹中比自己年幼的人。","pronunciation":["동생"]},{"id":"e27f0e273d4af17d","term":"싸우다","zh":"打架，争斗","audio":"/audio/e27f0e273d4af17d7ed1.mp3","entryId":"29732","definition":"想要获胜而用语言或力气等进行较量。","pronunciation":["싸우다"]}],"audio":"/audio/79a6a972c5205ef2030d.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n42192-1-9-2","ko":"내가 이 빵을 나눠 먹자고 했더니 단번에 입에 몽땅 넣어 버렸어요.","zh":"我本来提议一起分着吃这个面包的，结果他一下子全塞进自己嘴里了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"내가","meaning":"我","explanation":"나：我；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"나","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60931","senseId":"1","lemma":"나","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"내가","audio":"/audio/7ee3e480d2ca3192b2bc.mp3"}},{"text":"이","meaning":"这个","explanation":"이：这个","readings":[{"term":"이","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27527","senseId":"1","lemma":"이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"이","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3"}},{"text":"빵을","meaning":"面包","explanation":"빵：面包；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"빵","audio":"/audio/edc73c627b8f32b7f6a1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"23402","senseId":"1","lemma":"빵","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"빵을","audio":"/audio/5746ec238ed39e04704d.mp3"}},{"text":"나눠","meaning":"一起吃，分享","explanation":"나누다：一起吃，分享；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"나누다","audio":"/audio/8a88d2ae9895b06ef350.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29749","senseId":"5","lemma":"나누다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"나눠","audio":"/audio/619955ee27d4766a3569.mp3"}},{"text":"먹자고","meaning":"吃","explanation":"먹다：吃；자고：转述一起行动的提议：“提议、说一起……”。","readings":[{"term":"먹다","audio":"/audio/9639f892bdddb53fc055.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58272","senseId":"1","lemma":"먹다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"먹자고","audio":"/audio/08f0fb9f3aa6b25f07d0.mp3"}},{"text":"했더니","meaning":"说、转述（引用前面的话）","explanation":"하다：说、转述（引用前面的话）；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；더니：根据先前观察的情况，引出后来的变化、结果或对比。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"22","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"했더니","audio":"/audio/bda5287494be17f016ed.mp3"}},{"text":"단번에","meaning":"一下子，一口气","explanation":"단번에：一下子，一口气","readings":[{"term":"단번에","audio":"/audio/da9b26632ba7392689a2.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"42192","senseId":"1","lemma":"단번에","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"단번에","audio":"/audio/da9b26632ba7392689a2.mp3"}},{"text":"입에","meaning":"嘴，口","explanation":"입：嘴，口；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"입","audio":"/audio/c503f60b315f818ea268.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62276","senseId":"1","lemma":"입","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"입에","audio":"/audio/7132ed77fe8139e731f9.mp3"}},{"text":"몽땅","meaning":"都，全部","explanation":"몽땅：都，全部","readings":[{"term":"몽땅","audio":"/audio/82319e5dc862e392d58f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"54717","senseId":"1","lemma":"몽땅","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"몽땅","audio":"/audio/82319e5dc862e392d58f.mp3"}},{"text":"넣어","meaning":"放进，装进","explanation":"넣다：放进，装进；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"넣다","audio":"/audio/c0bd6058bd724000a75e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64509","senseId":"1","lemma":"넣다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"넣어","audio":"/audio/5917140fe7e2cfbda3f8.mp3"}},{"text":"버렸어요.","meaning":"做完、彻底结束（-아/어 버리다，可带遗憾或痛快语气）","explanation":"버리다：做完、彻底结束（-아/어 버리다，可带遗憾或痛快语气）；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"버리다","audio":"/audio/51654377be6bf0a0810e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62601","senseId":"1","lemma":"버리다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"버렸어요","audio":"/audio/f7e72b053ddd71d15838.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"1098bbe54520ab2a","term":"나","zh":"我","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3","entryId":"60931","definition":"说话人在朋友或晚辈面前用来指称自己。","pronunciation":["나"]},{"id":"8bafb6b7d17ead49","term":"이","zh":"这个","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3","entryId":"27527","definition":"指代离说话人较近的，或说话人所想的对象。","pronunciation":["이"]},{"id":"edc73c627b8f32b7","term":"빵","zh":"面包","audio":"/audio/edc73c627b8f32b7f6a1.mp3","entryId":"23402","definition":"将面粉揉和并使之发酵后，蒸或烤而成的食物。","pronunciation":["빵"]},{"id":"8a88d2ae9895b06e","term":"나누다","zh":"一起吃，分享","audio":"/audio/8a88d2ae9895b06ef350.mp3","entryId":"29749","definition":"一同或分着吃食物。","pronunciation":["나누다"]},{"id":"9639f892bdddb53f","term":"먹다","zh":"吃","audio":"/audio/9639f892bdddb53fc055.mp3","entryId":"58272","definition":"将食物送进口中并咽下。","pronunciation":["먹따"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"说、转述（引用前面的话）","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","definition":"说、转述（引用前面的话）","pronunciation":["하다"]},{"id":"da9b26632ba73926","term":"단번에","zh":"一下子，一口气","audio":"/audio/da9b26632ba7392689a2.mp3","entryId":"42192","definition":"一次就。","pronunciation":["단버네"]},{"id":"c503f60b315f818e","term":"입","zh":"嘴，口","audio":"/audio/c503f60b315f818ea268.mp3","entryId":"62276","definition":"吃食物、发音的器官，指从嘴唇到喉咙的部分。","pronunciation":["입"]},{"id":"82319e5dc862e392","term":"몽땅","zh":"都，全部","audio":"/audio/82319e5dc862e392d58f.mp3","entryId":"54717","definition":"一下子全都。","pronunciation":["몽땅"]},{"id":"c0bd6058bd724000","term":"넣다","zh":"放进，装进","audio":"/audio/c0bd6058bd724000a75e.mp3","entryId":"64509","definition":"使进入某个空间里。","pronunciation":["너ː타"]},{"id":"51654377be6bf0a0","term":"버리다","zh":"做完、彻底结束（-아/어 버리다，可带遗憾或痛快语气）","audio":"/audio/51654377be6bf0a0810e.mp3","entryId":"62601","definition":"做完、彻底结束（-아/어 버리다，可带遗憾或痛快语气）","pronunciation":["버리다"]}],"audio":"/audio/363b888426097990f94f.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.32,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=42192","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},